6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2117646662277713991","type":"quoted"}],"text":"科技股都拿一拿咯！民主党翻不起太大浪，美国不会让他们在AI的竞争中落败，一切的竞争都是算力的竞争！ https://t.co/RjmGVgnb1O","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119606586721366192"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:54:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119564230676664649"],"id":"2119564230676664649","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9908,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119444047349899363","type":"quoted"}],"text":"昨晚带大家吃瓜，凌晨4点多验证，怎么样，是不是全推特最强马前炮？我还知道更多消息，想了解的关注哦，慢慢放！ https://t.co/7TsrRefQCf","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119564230676664649"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:46:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119562333504884970"],"id":"2119562333504884970","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3832,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119444047349899363","type":"quoted"}],"text":"听说出轨的股票都涨的很厉害：\n\n$AMZN 自从贝佐斯在 2019 年背叛妻子以来，其市值增加了 2 万亿美元\n\n$MSFT 自从比尔·盖茨在 2021 年出轨以来，其市值增加了 2 万亿美元。\n\n$NVDA 刚刚宣布出轨，即将起飞？ https://t.co/7TsrRefQCf","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119562333504884970"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:39:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119560101787037861","2119560358008693224"],"id":"2119560358008693224","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2849,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚，黄仁勋承认出轨了！\n\n“我对妻子不忠。我的行为伤害了她和我们的孩子。我所做的事情没有任何借口。”\n\n“我全力致力于 NVIDIA，并将努力重新赢得你们的信任。”\n\n致英伟达公司全体的一封信，中英对照： https://t.co/TZnQEyrBE0","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119560358008693224"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T15:49:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119457398876508311"],"id":"2119457398876508311","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":1959,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"世上最容易招祸的一种聪明，就是看穿了别人的局，却没有掌控局面的本事。\n\n你要记住一句话，没有解决问题的能力，就不要轻易把问题挑破。\n\n为什么？因为看穿一个局，靠的是观察力和判断力，掌控一个局，靠的却是位置、资源、实力和解决问题的能力。这是两种完全不同的本事。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119457398876508311"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T14:56:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119438595039858691","2119439989834707181","2119444047349899363"],"id":"2119444047349899363","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":23779,"like_count":28,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"刚刚吃了1个黄仁勋的大瓜，我朋友的朋友是黄情人的前夫！知道了好多过去的事，哈哈。 https://t.co/be0nddrAiV","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119444047349899363"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T14:20:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119434922490466343"],"id":"2119434922490466343","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2748,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这辈子不就是我们上辈子想要的下辈子吗！\n现在拥有的生活，或许正是曾经的自己，隔着一世光阴，满怀期待想要抵达的远方。\n\n魂牵梦绕的为的就是回到此时此刻\n\n当我们真正活好今生，\n前世便得以释怀，\n来生也因此拥有了喜悦与圆满。\n\n今生，是唯一能够改变前世，\n也能够创造来生的地方。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119434922490466343"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:20:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119419842826764495"],"id":"2119419842826764495","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2264,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"量子力学：多种可能性的坍塌，有依赖于各种观察条件下的不同概率，你若足够聪明并提前说破揭穿，就是提前让未来大概率可能发生事件，在当下立刻坍塌，成为现实显现，而自己却没有提前实际行动，为可能性的坍塌完成应该的准备，就会成为道破天机的受害者。- 俗话说“天机不可泄露”也。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119419842826764495"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T12:29:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119406988660478386"],"id":"2119406988660478386","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2065,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119406865843146905","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"第五层：屁眼——只有同意才碰。\n想舔屁眼的，先问清楚。没同意就别碰，更别突然伸舌头。同意了，也要先洗干净，自己洗或者你帮他洗。肛周有毛的话，最好提前处理过。不干净就别做，这是底线。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119406988660478386"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T12:29:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119406865843146905"],"id":"2119406865843146905","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2624,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119406583130013882","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"第二层：腹股沟与根部，先把他腰眼舔软。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2119406865843146905"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:54:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119564230676664649"],"id":"2119564230676664649","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9908,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119444047349899363","type":"quoted"}],"text":"昨晚带大家吃瓜，凌晨4点多验证，怎么样，是不是全推特最强马前炮？我还知道更多消息，想了解的关注哦，慢慢放！ https://t.co/7TsrRefQCf"},{"author_id":"44196397","created_at":"2026-11-09T03:13:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119629310969467053"],"id":"2119629310969467053","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5933,"impression_count":10953202,"like_count":90816,"quote_count":6946,"reply_count":16647,"retweet_count":8406},"text":"Chinese 𝕏 is 牛逼"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-11-09T02:40:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119621217212825646"],"id":"2119621217212825646","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3919,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"人最后的成熟，就是停止展示自己，人最后的成熟，就是尽情地展示自己。"},{"author_id":"9284966285704273